Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2025 09:07:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Multi-host/HW-inventory: add processor subtree

This implements the processor subtree for multi-host system.
Requires a containing/contained_by association implemented in EM config
between Inventory.Item.System interface and Inventory.Item.Cpu.

The association does not require any addition in PDI, because PDI
describes the containing/contained_by association between multiple
Inventory.Item already as System and Cpu are of type Inventory.Item.

Tested on qemu/yosemite4 with custom EEProms and a custom config to
create CPU associations.

