busctl calls to see if the association is there:
```
busctl call xyz.openbmc_project.ObjectMapper /xyz/openbmc_project/object_mapper xyz.openbmc_project.ObjectMapper GetAssociatedSubTreePathsById ssassas Yosemite_4_Sentinel_Dome_T1_Slot_1 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system 1 xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Item.System "containing" 1 xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Item.Cpu
as 1 "/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cpu/Yosemite_4_Sentinel_Dome_Slot_1_CPU"

busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.EntityManager /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cpu/Yosemite_4_Sentinel_Dome_Slot_1_CPU xyz.openbmc_project.Association.Definitions Associations
a(sss) 1 "contained_by" "containing" "/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Yosemite_4_Sentinel_Dome_T1_Slot_1"
```

