Redfish_Validator running against QEMU/yosemite4 setup:
$1 is facilitated as argument to the URI.
```
BMC=127.0.0.1
USERNAME="root"
PASSWORD="0penBmc"

/tmp/rsv-venv/bin/rf_service_validator \
 --auth Session \
 --payload Tree /redfish/v1/Systems/$1 \
 -i https://${BMC}:4443 \
 -u ${USERNAME} -p ${PASSWORD}
```

